rights on the note (for replays too); (2) looks up an existing operation for the ticket's idempotency key â€” if found 
with the same binding, returns its status without new admission, regardless of later settings or source changes; if 
found with a different binding, rejects; (3) otherwise, with the note row locked, verifies that the bound settings 
revision is current and that the note's revision and transcript identity equal the ticket's (stale source â†’ 
