snapshot, and returns the matching key and the bound transcript text from the same snapshot. Settlement once, against 
the admission day, by a `service_role`-only RPC; it counts every dispatched operation, refunds only pre-processing 
rejections, and releases the reservation (not counted) for an operation that demonstrably never sent a request (size 
